{"clock":2,"ops":[{"kind":"edit-text","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793090781,"data":{"body":"Kinds as GitHub issue types (native-fields, merged locally into `bridge-sync` at 0420c69f) have only been tested on a fake GitHub. Run a live test on the EPFL-ENAC scratch repository from #29 before tagging.\n\n- [x] A bug labeled `bug` sets the type Bug, and `polish` stays a label.\n- [ ] A second kind, `feat`, goes as a label; swapping `bug` for `feat` makes the type Feature.\n- [x] A type chosen when the issue is created on GitHub comes in, and its timeline shows an `IssueTypeAddedEvent`.\n- [x] A type changed in GitHub's UI comes in with a normal (not full) sync, which tells whether a type change bumps `updatedAt`.\n- [x] An old `bug` label moves to the type, after `bridge pull \u003cname\u003e --no-resume`, a dry run, then a sync.\n- [x] `kinds = labels` moves types to labels, and switching back to native moves them back.\n- [ ] A fine-grained token can read `issueType` and run `updateIssueIssueType`. Check GitHub's real refusal text when it can't.\n- [ ] Each sync after these writes nothing.\n\nWith `kind-types = bug=Bug,feat=Feature`. Never co2-calculator, never Project 40.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- A bug labeled `bug` sets the type Bug, and `polish` stays a label.\n- A second kind, `feat`, goes as a label; swapping `bug` for `feat` makes the type Feature.\n- A type chosen when the issue is created on GitHub comes in, and its timeline shows an `IssueTypeAddedEvent`.\n- A type changed in GitHub's UI comes in with a normal (not full) sync, which tells whether a type change bumps `updatedAt`.\n- An old `bug` label moves to the type, after `bridge pull \u003cname\u003e --no-resume`, a dry run, then a sync.\n- `kinds = labels` moves types to labels, and switching back to native moves them back.\n- A fine-grained token can read `issueType` and run `updateIssueIssueType`. Check GitHub's real refusal text when it can't.\n- Each sync after these writes nothing.","target":"cc8f1914f1161a9f2c35807c15b10d7fde25413e:0"}}]}